    "about_the_game": "Educational journey Through the body in 8 Languages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You can see:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1-complete female body and run through it<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2- how the circulatory, digestive, urinary, respiratory and the auditory organs<br />\r\n from the inside look like&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3- Names of the organs and the tissues<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4- Information about some common disorders<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5- How these disorders affect the organs and the tissues<br />\r\n<br />\r\n6- these  disorders are:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cases of the White tongue<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cases of the (Strawberry) Red tongue<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cases of the Black hairy tongue<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Causes of dental caries (Tooth decay)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- pharyngitis<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Causes of the heartburn<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Achalasia<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Esophageal varices<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Schatzki Ring<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Causes of the stomach (Peptic) ulcer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Causes of the diarrhea<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Causes of the constipation<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - the colon polyp<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Earwax blockage<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Otitis media<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Asthma<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Smoker's lung",
